WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Turn an altered face upside down.
Sometimes the obvious looks ordinary.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The picture hasn't changed.
What does orientation do to what we notice?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Carry that skepticism to meditation products.
Twelve minutes is a format, not a result.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
An hour-of-meditation claim needs evidence
about that exact program.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start for free. Record what you actually did,
not what an advertisement says should happen.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then read the independent buyer questions
before deciding whether audio is worth paying for.
